alias purifier d0
alias analyzer d1
alias light d2
alias hasPollutedWater r0
alias hasCoal r1
alias purifierOn r2


Start:
yield

l hasPollutedWater analyzer RatioPollutedWater
sgtz hasPollutedWater hasPollutedWater
ls hasCoal purifier 0 Occupied

and purifierOn hasPollutedWater hasCoal
s purifier On purifierOn

bgtz hasCoal Start

s light On 1
sleep 0.5
s light On 0
sleep 0.5

j Start
